          },
          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Art Studio Adventure turns kids into the artist and gives them their very own studio to run! Across eight different studio adventures, new customers arrive with special requests for artwork, and it’s up to your child to create exactly what they’re looking for.Kids might draw a bright sunshine for a colorful bird, a green dinosaur with purple spots, a garden filled with flowers or a peaceful nighttime scene for an owl. Each customer gives simple instructions along with a studio checklist to help kids choose the colors and supplies they’ll need. As the adventures continue, the artwork becomes a little more detailed and challenging.Kids can use whatever art supplies they have at home including crayons, markers, colored pencils or paint. When it’s time to create, simply pause the audio and let them work for as long as they’d like. When their masterpiece is finished, press play to hear the customer’s reaction!A fun, screen-free way to encourage creativity, listening and independent art time while giving kids plenty of freedom to make each creation their own.Run Time: 29 minutes\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 9e5abb90d58679c1fd6d05948d67209945d8b3b8768c0ef6362eded171335868",
